needed. Pour into one glass and enjoy right away."],"cuisine":"American","user_id":null,"is_user_created":false,"source_url":null,"source_name":null},{"title":"Orange Cream Milkshake","description":"Frozen orange juice concentrate gives vanilla ice cream a bright orange-cream flavor.","meal_time":["dessert","snack"],"prep_time_mins":5,"effort_score":1,"servings":1,"tags":["shake","smoothies-and-shakes","quick","easy","treat-cold"],"image_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wyattrommel-code/Food-For-you/main/assets/recipe-photos/orange-cream-milkshake-326d9217cbf1.jpg","ingredients_list":["1/4 cup cold milk","1 cup vanilla ice cream","1 tablespoon frozen orange juice concentrate"],"shopping_list":["1/4 cup cold milk","1 cup vanilla ice cream","1 tablespoon frozen orange juice concentrate"],"recipe_steps":["Measure the milk into a blender. Let the ice cream stand for 2 minutes so it is easy to scoop.","Add the ice cream and the remaining measured ingredients. Cover and blend in short bursts until the mixture is smooth and pourable.","Turn off the blender before scraping down the sides if needed. Pour into one glass and enjoy right away."],"cuisine":"American","user_id":null,"is_user_created":false,"source_url":null,"source_name":null},{"title":"Strawberry Banana Smoothie","description":"An easy berry-and-banana blend using frozen strawberries and plain yogurt.","meal_time":["breakfast","snack"],"prep_time_mins":5,"effort_score":1,"servings":1,"tags":["smoothie","smoothies-and-shakes","quick","easy"],"image_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wyattrommel-code/Food-For-you/main/assets/recipe-photos/strawberry-banana-smoothie-49109ae1202b.jpg","ingredients_list":["1/2 cup cold milk","1/4 cup plain yogurt","1 cup frozen sliced strawberries","1/2 medium ripe banana, peeled and sliced"],"shopping_list":["1/2 cup cold milk","1/4 cup plain yogurt","1 cup frozen sliced strawberries","1/2 medium ripe banana, peeled and sliced"],"recipe_steps":["Measure the liquid into a